1
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,240
I am ill-fated

2
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,640
and destined to have no sons.

3
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:56,420
I only have you two daughters.

4
00:00:57,640 --> 00:00:58,840
Although I cannot

5
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:00,170
treat you both equally,

6
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:03,040
I promise

7
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:05,920
I will do my utmost to keep you safe.

8
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,440
As discussed,

9
00:01:09,039 --> 00:01:11,560
poison Ning Yuanci on your wedding night.

10
00:01:12,039 --> 00:01:13,960
I will send my men to coordinate with you,

11
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:16,160
helping you fake your death and escape.

12
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:22,360
My good daughter.

13
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:23,600
The survival

14
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:24,720
of the Xue family

15
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:26,160
is in your hands.

16
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,720
The auspicious hour has arrived.

17
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:30,850
Please head out now.

18
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,660
I just want to ask one more time

19
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:43,330
are you really the murderer

20
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,610
bribed by Ning Yuanci to poison me?

21
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,330
That is correct.

22
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,009
You must know...

23
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:52,680
Everyone in this world

24
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:53,580
might harm you,

25
00:01:54,039 --> 00:01:55,920
except your own parents.

26
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:17,000
I have something to tell you.

27
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:32,600
You regret it.

28
00:03:33,079 --> 00:03:34,600
Since I've made my decision,

29
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,600
I won't regret it.

30
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,290
But I just want to ask one thing.

31
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:39,500
What about Keying?

32
00:03:40,079 --> 00:03:42,410
What about your true feelings for Keying?

33
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:44,560
I never had

34
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:47,380
any true feelings for her.

35
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,540
My precious daughter,

36
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:50,890
please don't be sad.

37
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:52,160
If it doesn't work out,

38
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:53,820
just find another man to love.

39
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:54,760
Will that do?

40
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,240
Even though their marriage

41
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,700
is arranged by the script,

42
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:00,000
can Xue Ruowan

43
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,700
really remain safe and sound?

44
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,840
And Ning Yuanci's injuries,

45
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:05,920
I wonder if they are serious.

46
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:21,399
What are you doing,

47
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:22,500
being so restless?

48
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:24,400
Should I go to the General's Manor

49
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:25,240
to take a look?

50
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:27,100
I just need to make sure

51
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,160
they are safe.

52
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:33,020
Ying'er, where are you going?

53
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:41,480
The security in this general's manor

54
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,440
is too lax.

55
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:43,960
Anyone can sneak in

56
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:45,690
just by pretending to be a maid.

57
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:52,930
Strange.

58
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:54,370
Why is it so quiet

59
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:55,480
on a wedding night?

60
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,530
I haven't seen a single person.

61
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:27,800
What happened here?

62
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,740
Where is your general?

63
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,160
Who are you?

64
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,560
I've never seen you before.

65
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:32,960
I...

66
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:37,320
Oh no,

67
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:39,120
there's a fire!

68
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,000
Oh no,

69
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:40,800
fire!

70
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,120
Which room is the bride in?

71
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:42,840
Somebody come!

72
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,000
I don't know.

73
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:45,280
Somebody come, hurry!

74
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:45,880
Forget it.

75
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,800
Put out the fire, hurry!

76
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,090
Hurry up.

77
00:05:51,840 --> 00:05:52,370
This way.

78
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:55,659
Xue Ruowan!

79
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:57,560
Did Father send you?

80
00:05:58,440 --> 00:06:00,170
What does it have to do with him?

81
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:01,720
Where is Ning Yuanci?

82
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:03,400
Why isn't he with you?

83
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,600
Never mind. Let's go.

84
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:07,250
I'm not leaving.

85
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,760
I want to wait a bit longer.

86
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:09,560
Wait for what?

87
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:10,360
To die?

88
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:10,920
Go!

89
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:11,900
Leave me alone.

90
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:12,780
Hurry up and go.

91
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:13,580
Xue Ruowan!

92
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:15,040
Stop trying to get yourself killed,

93
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:15,570
will you?

94
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:17,960
If you don't want to live, I do.

95
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,120
Let's go!

96
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,800
Did Father send you?

97
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:22,520
Great.

98
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:23,960
Help me drag her away.

99
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,000
Hurry.

100
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:33,560
Xue Keying!

101
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,560
Ning Yuanci.

102
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,210
As long as...

103
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,320
as long as you are fine.

104
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,360
Xue Keying!

105
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:56,980
Xue Keying!

106
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,080
Xue Keying!

107
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,020
Xue Keying!

108
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:04,720
Keying!

109
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,050
Somebody, help!

110
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,130
Get a doctor, quick!

111
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:09,920
General!

112
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,010
General!

113
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,360
If you fail the plot missions

114
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,020
five times,

115
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,720
you will be stuck

116
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:21,000
in the script world forever.

117
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,280
Please get the plot back on track

118
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,520
as soon as possible.

119
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:25,160
Please hurry.

120
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:25,760
Do I have

121
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:26,560
to start over again

122
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:28,160
to get the plot back on track?

123
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,330
General,

124
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:42,460
you're finally awake.

125
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,560
General,

126
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:45,159
No

127
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:46,720
way.

128
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,120
Where's the character bio?

129
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,250
Why isn't there one?

130
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:54,610
General,

131
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:55,960
what are you looking for?

132
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:56,880
Help!

133
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:59,520
I actually transmigrated into Ning Yuanci!

134
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:00,180
I'm doomed.

135
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:02,360
I only have one last chance left.

136
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,360
I finally got

137
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:04,760
my own body back.

138
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:06,930
General,

139
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,960
your wound is torn badly.

140
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:12,000
The imperial physician
told you not to move around.

141
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,080
How could Xue Keying

142
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,600
just die like this?

143
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:16,360
She was severely injured,

144
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,420
but she is not dead.

145
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,330
What did you say?

146
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:22,480
Xue

147
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:24,800
Keying!

148
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,840
Fortunately, the General

149
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:28,480
rescued her from the fire last night.

150
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:30,000
Thanks to the timely treatment
by the imperial physician,

151
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,060
her life was saved.

152
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:33,010
But for some reason,

153
00:08:33,520 --> 00:08:35,919
she won't respond
no matter how we call her.

154
00:08:37,559 --> 00:08:38,000
Cui Hu,

155
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:39,159
pour me a cup of water.

156
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:39,520
Yes.

157
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:45,420
The fire last night...

158
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:46,360
That means

159
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:47,920
the timeline

160
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:49,320
didn't restart the loop,

161
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,200
but continued.

162
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:51,640
But why did I

163
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:52,770
become Ning Yuanci,

164
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:55,600
while Xue Keying remains unconscious?

165
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:56,640
Could it be...

166
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:58,560
Ning

167
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:01,840
Yuanci!

168
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:08,560
I never had true feelings for him.

169
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:10,040
You can fool others

170
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,920
about your true feelings,

171
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:13,520
but you can't fool yourself.

172
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:14,960
I won't believe Xiaolan

173
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,420
is the one who poisoned me.

174
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:19,010
Nor would I kill someone

175
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,210
just to save myself.

176
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,680
Come on, let's drink.

177
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:28,360
A toast to you. Come on, quick.

178
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,520
Get out, all of you!

179
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,080
Why is

180
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,970
the General losing his temper?

181
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:35,720
Hurry.

182
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:36,730
Let's go.

183
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:37,810
General,

184
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:38,720
your wound...

185
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:40,960
Summon the imperial physician!

186
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,320
General, bad news!

187
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,520
The backyard is on fire!

188
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:48,520
The Second Lady of the Duke's Estate

189
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:50,450
seems to be here to save people too.

190
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:55,810
Sun Xiaofei,

191
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,120
I actually treated you

192
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,320
as my best friend.

193
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,040
Yet you stole my role

194
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,680
with such despicable means.

195
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:05,180
Give me my face back right now.

196
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:06,240
Let go of me.

197
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:08,000
Let go.

198
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:11,690
I'm here to save you.

199
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,720
The one who wants to kill you
is Ning Yuanci.

200
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,560
No!

201
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:17,600
Stop!

202
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:20,560
I'd like to see who dares to hit her.

203
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:21,490
Don't be afraid.

204
00:10:27,640 --> 00:10:28,170
General,

205
00:10:28,800 --> 00:10:31,000
you should go back to your room and rest.

206
00:10:33,280 --> 00:10:33,800
I'm fine.

207
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:34,530
Your body...

208
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:37,080
By the way,

209
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,210
where is Xue Ruowan?

210
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:45,760
She...

211
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:46,810
Although

212
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:47,760
Xue Ruowan didn't poison

213
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:48,720
the General as instructed

214
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,450
by Duke Ying,

215
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:50,680
I believe

216
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,800
the arson and assassination

217
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:54,170
were a trap set by her

218
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:55,120
and the Duke.

219
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:56,520
What?

220
00:10:57,800 --> 00:10:58,400
My father?

221
00:10:58,560 --> 00:10:58,960
No.

222
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:02,400
Her father ordered her
to assassinate Ning...

223
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:03,520
assassinate me?

224
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:05,720
How come you're involved in murder

225
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,520
and arson too?

226
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:08,200
How many things are you hiding

227
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:09,130
from Xue Keying?

228
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:10,610
My father

229
00:11:11,040 --> 00:11:12,170
told me to poison you

230
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,260
on our wedding day.

231
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:15,280
He said he would send someone to help me

232
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:16,080
escape.

233
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,180
But I didn't expect

234
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:19,600
the person he sent

235
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:20,740
was here to kill me.

236
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:23,100
This Xue Shiyan

237
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:24,600
always acts like

238
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,840
a loving father,

239
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:27,840
but he's actually ruthless.

240
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:28,680
He even used his own

241
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:30,320
daughter's life for power.

242
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:32,360
I agreed to marry you
because I didn't want

243
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,890
Xue Keying to take the risk,

244
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:35,880
pretending to turn against him.

245
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:37,100
But I didn't expect

246
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:40,080
her to come and save me again.

247
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:41,440
So Xue Ruowan's

248
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:43,080
character didn't collapse.

249
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:44,010
As expected,

250
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:47,140
there's always a reason
when the female lead turns bad.

251
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:52,180
Thank you, General, for saving my sister

252
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:54,680
and preventing me from
making a huge mistake.

253
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:55,440
From the moment

254
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,640
I gave you the poison,

255
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:57,800
I already knew

256
00:11:57,800 --> 00:11:58,560
my fate.

257
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:01,740
Please take good care
of my sister, General.

258
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,240
I am at your disposal.

259
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,120
Disposal?

260
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,800
Are you in such a hurry to die?

261
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:08,520
General, please don't

262
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:09,450
be fooled by her.

263
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:10,740
We should capture her,

264
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,640
torture her for a confession,

265
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:14,240
and then confront Duke Ying.

266
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:16,140
We can't touch her now.

267
00:12:16,160 --> 00:12:16,600
Get up.

268
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:19,540
Report!

269
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:20,720
Duke Ying brought his men

270
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:21,840
to surround the general's mansion,

271
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,400
demanding the general
release his daughter.

272
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:24,280
He wants to see her alive

273
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:24,880
or dead.

274
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:25,320
What?

275
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,080
He has the nerve to come here?
